    "id": "user_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edge~policy~microsoft_edge~contentsettings_localfontsallowedforurls",
    "description": "Specifies a list of site URL patterns for which the local fonts permission is automatically granted. Sites in this list can access information about local fonts.\n\nFor detailed information about valid URL patterns, see https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2095322. Wildcards, *, are supported. This policy matches based on origin only; any path in the URL pattern is ignored.\n\nIf a site isn't included in this policy, the 'DefaultLocalFontsSetting' (Default Local Fonts permission setting) policy applies if configured. Otherwise, the browser default behavior applies, and users can choose the permission on a per-site basis.\n\nExample value:\n\nhttps://www.example.com\n[*.]example.edu",
